      "writtenOn": "2026-11-03T18:11:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I initially implemented it that way, and then had second thoughts.\n\nMy concern was the following: is there any case where, at creation time, we might have information we don\u0027t want to serialize in the event? \n\nInitially, I was thinking about sensitive information, but I don\u0027t think there is any risk. Bottom line I am happy to revert to a `String`.",
